    "No files deleted, moved, or modified in scheme-lang/. All 21
     originals remain at their original paths per the no-deletes
     doctrine. Migrated copies live independently in motoi-scheme/lib/."

  :motoi-scheme-src
    "motoi-scheme/src/ untouched. dispatch.js's non-hermetic imports
     documented but NOT patched in Wave 1 (Wave 5 concern)."

  :package-json
    "motoi-scheme/package.json exports map is unchanged. Wave-1 lib
     modules are addressable via long paths (e.g.
     import '/motoi-scheme/lib/graphics/framebuffer.js'). Wave 2 should
     add './lib/*' export mapping.")

